    <div class="container">
        <div class="hero" id="home">
            <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Emblema App" style="max-width:220px; margin:1rem auto; display:block; border-radius:12px; border:2px solid #D4AF37;">
            <h2>Vigilanza Partecipata per L'Aquila</h2>
            <p>Strumento di prevenzione della criminalitÃ  basato sulla solidarietÃ  tra cittadini e sulla collaborazione con le Forze di Polizia. Alza il livello di attenzione, segnala le anomalie, proteggi il tuo quartiere.</p>
            <p style="margin-top:1rem; font-style:italic; color:var(--gold); font-weight:600;">IMMOTA MANET</p>
            <div class="stats">
                <div class="stat-box"><div class="num" id="totalReports">0</div><div>Segnalazioni</div></div>
                <div class="stat-box"><div class="num" id="openReports">0</div><div>Aperte</div></div>
                <div class="stat-box"><div class="num" id="highPriority">0</div><div>Alta prioritÃ </div></div>
                <div class="stat-box"><div class="num">12</div><div>Zone attive</div></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section" id="segnala">
            <h2>Segnala una Situazione Anomala</h2>
            <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Compila il modulo. La segnalazione sarÃ  inviata al Coordinatore del tuo gruppo. <strong>In caso di emergenza in corso chiama subito il Numero Unico di Emergenza 112.</strong></p>
            <form id="reportForm">
                <label>Tipo di segnalazione *</label>
                <select id="tipo" required="">
                    <option value="">Seleziona...</option>
                    <option>Persona sospetta</option>
                    <option>Veicolo sospetto / targa</option>
                    <option>Atti vandalici</option>
                    <option>Degrado urbano</option>
                    <option>Ostacolo sulla strada</option>
                    <option>Persona in difficoltÃ </option>
                    <option>Furto / tentativo in corso</option>
                    <option>Scarsa illuminazione / fattore di rischio</option>
                    <option>Altro</option>
                </select>
                <label>PrioritÃ </label>
                <select id="priorita">
                    <option value="normale">Normale</option>
                    <option value="alta">Alta (urgenza)</option>
                </select>
                <label>Zona / Quartiere *</label>
                <select id="zona" required="">
                    <option value="">Seleziona zona...</option>
                    <option>Centro Storico - Quarto San Pietro</option>
                    <option>Centro Storico - Quarto Santa Maria</option>
                    <option>Centro Storico - Quarto San Giovanni / San Giorgio</option>
                    <option>Pile / Santa Barbara</option>
                    <option>Coppito / Pettino</option>
                    <option>Roio</option>
                    <option>Sassa</option>
                    <option>Paganica</option>
                    <option>Arischia</option>
                    <option>Camarda / Assergi</option>
                    <option>Bagno</option>
                    <option>Torrione</option>
                    <option>Altra zona</option>
                </select>
                <label>Descrizione dettagliata *</label>
                <textarea id="descrizione" placeholder="Descrivi cosa hai visto, orario, caratteristiche (colore auto, abbigliamento, ecc.)..." required=""></textarea>
                <label>Indirizzo o punto di riferimento</label>
                <input type="text" id="indirizzo" placeholder="Via, piazza, vicino a...">
                <button type="button" class="btn-geo" id="geoBtn">Usa la mia posizione attuale</button>
                <label>Tuo nome / contatto (facoltativo)</label>
                <input type="text" id="contatto" placeholder="Nome o telefono">
                <label>Foto (facoltativa)</label>
                <input type="file" id="foto" accept="image/*">
                <img id="fotoPreview" alt="Anteprima">
                <button type="submit">Invia Segnalazione al Coordinatore</button>
            </form>
            <div id="successMsg" class="hidden" style="margin-top:1rem; padding:1rem; background:#e8f5e9; border-radius:8px; color:var(--green); font-weight:600;">
                Segnalazione inviata con successo al Coordinatore del gruppo!
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section" id="mappa">
            <h2>Mappa delle Zone di Controllo</h2>
            <div id="map" class="leaflet-container leaflet-touch leaflet-retina leaflet-fade-anim leaflet-grab leaflet-touch-drag leaflet-touch-zoom" tabindex="0" style="position: relative;"><div class="leaflet-pane leaflet-map-pane" style="transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);"><div class="leaflet-pane leaflet-tile-pane"><div class="leaflet-layer " style="z-index: 1; opacity: 1;"><div class="leaflet-tile-container leaflet-zoom-animated" style="z-index: 18; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px) scale(1);"><img alt="" src="https://a.tile.openstreetmap.org/12/2200/1514.png" class="leaflet-tile leaflet-tile-loaded" style="width: 256px; height: 256px; transform: translate3d(24px, -67px, 0px); opacity: 1;"><img alt="" src="https://b.tile.openstreetmap.org/12/2200/1515.png" class="leaflet-tile leaflet-tile-loaded" style="width: 256px; height: 256px; transform: translate3d(24px, 189px, 0px); opacity: 1;"><img alt="" src="https://c.tile.openstreetmap.org/12/2199/1514.png" class="leaflet-tile leaflet-tile-loaded" style="width: 256px; height: 256px; transform: translate3d(-232px, -67px, 0px); opacity: 1;"><img alt="" src="https://b.tile.openstreetmap.org/12/2201/1514.png" class="leaflet-tile leaflet-tile-loaded" style="width: 256px; height: 256px; transform: translate3d(280px, -67px, 0px); opacity: 1;"><img alt="" src="https://a.tile.openstreetmap.org/12/2199/1515.png" class="leaflet-tile leaflet-tile-loaded" style="width: 256px; height: 256px; transform: translate3d(-232px, 189px, 0px); opacity: 1;"><img alt="" src="https://c.tile.openstreetmap.org/12/2201/1515.png" class="leaflet-tile leaflet-tile-loaded" style="width: 256px; height: 256px; transform: translate3d(280px, 189px, 0px); opacity: 1;"></div></div></div><div class="leaflet-pane leaflet-overlay-pane"></div><div class="leaflet-pane leaflet-shadow-pane"><img src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/images/marker-shadow.png" class="leaflet-marker-shadow leaflet-zoom-animated" alt="" style="margin-left: -12px; margin-top: -41px; width: 41px; height: 41px; transform: translate3d(139px, 223px, 0px);"><img src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/images/marker-shadow.png" class="leaflet-marker-shadow leaflet-zoom-animated" alt="" style="margin-left: -12px; margin-top: -41px; width: 41px; height: 41px; transform: translate3d(55px, 164px, 0px);"><img src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/images/marker-shadow.png" class="leaflet-marker-shadow leaflet-zoom-animated" alt="" style="margin-left: -12px; margin-top: -41px; width: 41px; height: 41px; transform: translate3d(-18px, 144px, 0px);"><img src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/images/marker-shadow.png" class="leaflet-marker-shadow leaflet-zoom-animated" alt="" style="margin-left: -12px; margin-top: -41px; width: 41px; height: 41px; transform: translate3d(201px, 262px, 0px);"><img src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/images/marker-shadow.png" class="leaflet-marker-shadow leaflet-zoom-animated" alt="" style="margin-left: -12px; margin-top: -41px; width: 41px; height: 41px; transform: translate3d(288px, 183px, 0px);"><img src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/images/marker-shadow.png" class="leaflet-marker-shadow leaflet-zoom-animated" alt="" style="margin-left: -12px; margin-top: -41px; width: 41px; height: 41px; transform: translate3d(-32px, -14px, 0px);"><img src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/images/marker-shadow.png" class="leaflet-marker-shadow leaflet-zoom-animated" alt="" style="margin-left: -12px; margin-top: -41px; width: 41px; height: 41px; transform: translate3d(84px, 301px, 0px);"></div><div class="leaflet-pane leaflet-marker-pane"><img src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/images/marker-icon-2x.png" class="leaflet-marker-icon leaflet-zoom-animated leaflet-interactive" alt="Marker" tabindex="0" role="button" style="margin-left: -12px; margin-top: -41px; width: 25px; height: 41px; transform: translate3d(139px, 223px, 0px); z-index: 223;"><img src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/images/mar